# electron-builder output: packaged .app bundles, DMGs and zips. Hundreds of
# megabytes of binaries rebuilt by `pnpm package` on demand.
#
# Any `release*` directory, not just `release/`: a build run with a different
# output dir once put a 167MB Electron Framework into a commit, which GitHub
# refuses outright — and the failure lands at push time, long after the mistake.
release*/
